        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "But the same warning: though writers of the best prose will separate short grammatical sentences with just a comma, many teachers disapprove. That's because a comma alone is traditionally condemned as a comma splice, in their view a grave error. So be sure of your readers before you experiment.",
