        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When you begin a grammatical sentence with but, you can either put a comma at the end of the previous sentence or begin a new punctuated sentence by using a period and capitalizing but. Use a period + But if what follows is important and you intend to go on discussing it:",
